## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical embedding of ICA in hardware, focusing on fixed-point constraints, online updates, and robustness to dropouts.

## Key Concepts
- Online whitening with forgetting factor
- Fixed-point arithmetic and quantization
- Per-bin ICA vs joint diagonalization trade-offs
- Permutation alignment and dropout handling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: update step
function updateStep(W, x) {
  let y = multiply(W, x);
  let grad = outerProduct(x, y).negate();
  W = add(W, scale(grad, eta));
  return W;
}
```

